          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiba eng’ Kades, ak kiimuung’e tulwetab Hor, ole bochin kiwotetab emetab Edom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitogosta Aron tisiindet tulwetab Hor, eng’ ng’atutietab Jehovah, ak kimechi oloto, eng’ kenyitab artam koboch ngab komong’une lagokab Israel emetab Misri, eng’ arawetab mut, eng’ betut ne bo tai eng’ arawanato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiga kotar Aron kenyisiek bogol ak tiptem ak somok ye kingomeei eng’ tulwetab Hor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kigas Kananindet laitoriatab Arad, ne kimenyei Murot ne bo Tai eng’ emetab Kanan, kole bwanei lagokab Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiba eng’ tulwetab Hor, ak komuung’e Salmona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiba eng’ Salmona, ak kiimuung’e Bunon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiba eng’ Bunon, ak kiimuung’e Obot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiba eng’ Obot, ak kiimuung’e Iyeabarim, eng’ kiwotetab Moab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiba eng’ Iyim, ak kiimuung’e Dibon-gad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiba eng’ Dibon-gad, ak kiimuung’e Almon-diblataim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiba eng’ Almon-diblataim, ak kiimuung’e tulonokab Abarim, ole tokyingei Nebo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiba eng’ tulonokab Abarim, ak kiimuung’e warengetab Moab ole negite Jordan eng’ Jeriko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiimuung’e ole negite Jordan, koboch Bet-jesimot agoi Abel-sitim eng’ warengetab Moab.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Keng’atei Israel koon Kananik ak kong’em konamonikwak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimwachi Jehovah Musa eng’ warengetab Moab, ole negit Jordan, eng’ Jeriko kolenji, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwachi lagokab Israel, ilenji, Ye olandoe Jordan obe emetab Kanan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oon anyun bik tugul che menyei emonoto, koba eng’ taing’wong’, ak ong’em koikwak che saei, ak ong’em kanamonikwak che kigitanyi, ak obut oldinwekwak tugul che tororen: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak onam emet kobunjok, ak omeny: amu kiagonok emonoto kobunjok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak opchechige emonoto onyabani, eng’ seretab barbarek ko u ortinwekwok; ogochini che chang’ borotet ne o, ak ogochini che ng’ering’ borotet ne ming’in: oldo tugul ole kaibutyi barbariatab chi, koek nenyi noto; onyabani ko u bororiosiekab kwanisiekwok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago ngo moon bik che menyei emet, koba eng’ taing’wong’, kogergeitu eng’ konyekwok ak tuguk che toorei bich, ak katok eng’ karaswekwok, icheget che ochamjini kong’et, ak konyalilak eng’ emet ne omenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak tun ayaiywok ko u ye kiabwati ale ayachjini ichek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
